Description: macOS Live Text-style OCR utility for Ubuntu
 Select any rectangular region on your screen — including paused videos,
 PDFs, slides, images, or terminals — and instantly extract and copy the
 text to your clipboard. Includes an interactive overlay, top-panel
 indicator, QR/barcode scanning, clipboard history, and global shortcut.
